  "notes": "The entry canopy has a small shingled gable carried on slender painted posts. The trees obscure much of the house. Window counts, division of the west addition and step count are approximate. Black railings flank the porch landing. The north and south cheeks of the rear addition have low tan roofs on either side of the grey cross gable.",
